flowchart TD
  Full[Complete catalog and unassigned queue] --> Index[Functional group index with provenance]
  Job[Job description and constraints] --> Search[Deterministic bounded discovery]
  Index --> Search
  Search --> Summary[Ranked summaries and scoped cursor]
  Summary --> Describe[Fetch selected coherent group manifest]
  Describe --> Plan[Dependency closure and byte budget]
  Plan --> CAS[Atomic session view CAS and epoch checks]
  CAS --> Portable[Default bootstrap and generic invoke]
  CAS --> Dynamic[Opt in dynamic aliases]
  Dynamic --> Notify[Standard tools list changed hint]
  Portable --> Gate[Current policy and Android authority]
  Dynamic --> Gate
